{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Thronebreaker: Bloodlines of Rebellion</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Every kingdom starts with a betrayal.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Years ago, your family was slaughtered under the banner of a tyrant king.<br>Now, after years of strategy, deceit, and rebellion\u2014you\u2019ve taken the throne for yourself. But power has a price. As the crown rests heavy on your head, a darker game begins\u2026</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udde1\ufe0f <strong>A New Threat Rises</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just when peace seems within reach, you\u2019re struck down by an assassination attempt.<br>You survive\u2014but barely. Years have passed.<br>You\u2019re older. Slower. And now\u2026 you\u2019re not the only one who bleeds for truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your son takes up the mantle. Together, you must uncover who is behind the dagger\u2026 and why your reign still threatens the shadows in your kingdom.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Game Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udff0 <i>A rich, grounded medieval visual novel</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd1d <i>Over 100 impactful choices that shape your path</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd00 <i>Multiple endings based on your loyalty, cruelty or mercy</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd0d <i>A dual-timeline narrative: from rebellion to revenge</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfad <i>Complex characters, political tension, family, betrayal</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 <i>Stunning ultra-realistic art and handcrafted scenes</i></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udde0 <strong>Your decisions forge your legacy.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will your bloodline bring peace to the realm\u2014or drown it in civil war?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The image